+  (∀ (s : Bool), ¬s = true → 1 < 1) → ∀ (s : Bool), ∃ n, n ≤ 1 ∧ iterate id n s = true : Prop
+but is expected to have type
+  ∃ n, iterate id n s = true : Prop
